## Testing Patterns in Kotlin Project - Comprehensive Analysis

Based on my thorough exploration of the integrated-search project, here's what I found:

### 1. **Integration Test Structure with @SpringBootTest + Kotest FunSpec**

The project uses a consistent pattern across multiple test files. Here are key examples:

#### Pattern A: External API Integration Tests
**File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/legacy-api/src/test/kotlin/com/cowave/search/client/legacy_api/LegacyApiTest.kt`
```kotlin
@SpringBootTest(
    classes = [
        LegacyApiClientConfig::class,
        LegacyApiClient::class,
    ],
)
@EnableConfigurationProperties(
    LegacyApiClientProperties::class,
)
class LegacyApiTest(
    private val legacyApiClient: LegacyApiClient,
) : FunSpec({
    // Tests defined here
})
```

#### Pattern B: Calling Real External APIs (GraphQL)
**File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/proxy-api/src/test/kotlin/com/cowave/search/client/proxy_api/ProxyApiClientTest.kt`
```kotlin
@SpringBootTest(
    classes = [
        ProxyApiClientConfig::class,
        ProxyApiClient::class,
    ]
)
@EnableConfigurationProperties(
    ProxyApiClientProperties::class,
)
class ProxyApiClientTest(
    private val client: ProxyApiClient
) : FunSpec({
    test("GraphQL query test") {
        val query = """query GetBrands(${'$'}ids: [Long!]!) { ... }"""
        val list = client.query(query, variables, retrievePath, clazz)
        list.size shouldBe 2
    }
})
```

#### Pattern C: Cache/Repository Integration Tests
**File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/repository/cache/src/test/kotlin/com/cowave/search/repository/cache/BrandValkeyRepositoryTest.kt`
```kotlin
@SpringBootTest(
    classes = [
        ValkeyConfig::class,
        BrandValkeyRepository::class,
    ]
)
@EnableConfigurationProperties(
    ValkeyProperties::class,
)
class BrandValkeyRepositoryTest(
    private val repository: BrandValkeyRepository,
) : FunSpec({
    test("기본적인 multi get, multi set 테스트") {
        val brands = dummyBrands()
        repository.putAll(brands)
        val result = repository.getAll(listOf(1L, 2L, 3L))
        result.size shouldBe 3
    }
})
```

#### Pattern D: Unit Tests with Mocks (No Spring)
**File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/repository/cache/src/test/kotlin/com/cowave/search/repository/cache/MallValkeyRepositoryUnitTest.kt`
```kotlin
class MallValkeyRepositoryUnitTest : FunSpec({
    val redisTemplate = mockk<RedisTemplate<String, String>>()
    val valueOps = mockk<ValueOperations<String, String>>(relaxed = true)
    val repository = MallValkeyRepository(redisTemplate)

    beforeEach {
        every { redisTemplate.opsForValue() } returns valueOps
    }

    test("getAllByIds - 존재하는 데이터를 조회하면 엔티티 리스트를 반환한다") {
        every { valueOps.multiGet(any<Collection<String>>()) } returns listOf(...)
        val result = repository.getAllByIds(listOf(1, 2))
        result.size shouldBe 2
    }
})
```

#### Pattern E: Mocked External API Calls
**File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound-adapter/legacy/src/test/kotlin/com/cowave/search/outbound_adapter/legacy/LegacySyncRepositoryImplTest.kt`
```kotlin
class LegacySyncRepositoryImplTest : FunSpec({
    val legacyApiClient = mockk<LegacyApiClient>()
    val repository = LegacySyncRepositoryImpl(legacyApiClient)

    beforeEach {
        coEvery { legacyApiClient.pushQueue(any(), any(), any()) } returns Unit
    }

    context("pushLinkedProducts") {
        test("CREATE 연동상품 동기화 - POST로 호출한다") {
            val serviceSlot = slot<String>()
            val methodSlot = slot<HttpMethod>()

            coEvery {
                legacyApiClient.pushQueue(capture(serviceSlot), capture(methodSlot), any())
            } returns Unit

            repository.pushLinkedProducts(products, Operation.CREATE)

            serviceSlot.captured shouldBe "PDM"
            methodSlot.captured shouldBe HttpMethod.POST
            coVerify(exactly = 1) { legacyApiClient.pushQueue("PDM", HttpMethod.POST, products) }
        }
    }
})
```

#### Pattern F: Pure Unit Tests (No Spring Context)
**File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/domain/search/src/test/kotlin/com/cowave/search/domain/document/UsedRentalDetectorTest.kt`
```kotlin
class UsedRentalDetectorTest : FunSpec({
    context("모델(serviceGubun=1) 테스트") {
        test("중고 키워드가 있으면 true 반환") {
            val result = UsedRentalDetector.isUsedOrRentalForCatalog(
                categoryId1 = 1501,
                name = "삼성 냉장고 리퍼상품",
            )
            result shouldBe true
        }
    }
})
```

### 2. **Test Dependencies Configuration**

**Root build.gradle.kts** (`/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/build.gradle.kts`):
```kotlin
val kotestVersion = "5.9.1"

dependencyManagement {
    dependencies {
        dependency("io.kotest:kotest-property-jvm:$kotestVersion")
        dependency("io.kotest:kotest-runner-junit5-jvm:$kotestVersion")
        dependency("io.kotest:kotest-assertions-core-jvm:$kotestVersion")
        dependency("io.kotest.extensions:kotest-extensions-spring:1.1.3")
        dependency("io.kotest.extensions:kotest-extensions-testcontainers:2.0.2")
    }
}

tasks.withType<Test> {
    useJUnitPlatform()
}
```

**Module-level test dependencies** (consistent pattern):
```kotlin
testImplementation("org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-test")
testImplementation("org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-test-junit5")
testImplementation("io.kotest:kotest-runner-junit5-jvm")
testImplementation("io.kotest:kotest-assertions-core-jvm")
testImplementation("io.kotest.extensions:kotest-extensions-spring")
testImplementation("io.mockk:mockk:1.13.13")  // For mocking
```

### 3. **Test Configuration Files**

**For External API Calls** - `outbound/client/legacy-api/src/test/resources/application.properties`:
```properties
client.legacy-api.base-url=119.205.208.36:8080
client.legacy-api.timeout=500
```

**For GraphQL API** - `outbound/client/proxy-api/src/test/resources/application.properties`:
```properties
client.proxy-api.base-url=dev-shopping-internal.danuricorp.com/graphql
client.proxy-api.username=admin
client.proxy-api.password=Uqd}}e0?3]v@zaV?MKa>,YxK4K-
```

**For Cache/Valkey** - `outbound/repository/cache/src/test/resources/application.properties`:
```properties
valkey.backend.hosts=localhost:6379,localhost:6380,localhost:6381
valkey.backend.database=0
```

### 4. **Test Files Overview**

| Test File | Type | Pattern | Purpose |
|-----------|------|---------|---------|
| `LegacyApiTest.kt` | Integration | @SpringBootTest + FunSpec | Tests legacy API client config & external API calls |
| `ProxyApiClientTest.kt` | Integration | @SpringBootTest + FunSpec | Tests GraphQL client against real API |
| `BrandValkeyRepositoryTest.kt` | Integration | @SpringBootTest + FunSpec | Tests Valkey cache (requires docker-compose) |
| `MallValkeyRepositoryUnitTest.kt` | Unit | FunSpec + Mocks (mockk) | Tests with mocked Redis |
| `BrandProxyReaderImplTest.kt` | Integration | @SpringBootTest + FunSpec | Tests proxy reader with real GraphQL API |
| `LegacySyncRepositoryImplTest.kt` | Unit | FunSpec + Mocks | Tests sync logic with mocked API client |
| `UsedRentalDetectorTest.kt` | Unit | FunSpec (no Spring) | Tests pure business logic |

### 5. **Key Patterns & Best Practices Observed**

1. **Consistent Kotest FunSpec structure** - All tests extend `FunSpec()`
2. **Constructor injection** - Dependencies injected via constructor in @SpringBootTest classes
3. **@EnableConfigurationProperties** - Used to load configuration from application.properties
4. **Test context isolation** - Classes specified in `@SpringBootTest(classes = [...])`
5. **mockk for coroutines** - Uses `coEvery` and `coVerify` for suspend functions
6. **Slot & capture** - Captures method arguments for verification
7. **Helper functions** - `beforeEach`, `context()`, `test()` blocks for organization
8. **External API integration** - Tests actually call real endpoints (not mocked)
9. **No testcontainers usage yet** - Despite being in dependencies, no current usage
10. **Kotlin-style assertions** - Uses Kotest matchers like `shouldBe` instead of JUnit

### 6. **Module Structure Summary**

```
integrated-search/
├── outbound/client/legacy-api/          (External legacy system API client)
├── outbound/client/proxy-api/           (GraphQL proxy API client)
├── outbound/repository/cache/           (Valkey cache repository)
├── outbound-adapter/legacy/             (Legacy sync adapter with mocking tests)
├── outbound-adapter/proxy/              (Proxy adapter with integration tests)
├── domain/search/                       (Pure unit tests, no Spring)
├── shared/                              (gRPC & serialization utilities)
└── build.gradle.kts                     (Root with JUnit5 + Kotest + mockk setup)
```

This structure gives you multiple patterns to reference when writing your LegacyApiTest integration tests!
